          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Become a Princess of a Magical Castle! Pretty Princess Party on the Nintendo Switch transports you to a magical land to explore a long-abandoned enchanted castle. Learn to be a princess and decorate the castle any way you wish.\n\nBegin by creating a princess character with endless choices of dresses, shoes, accessories, and hairstyles. Then train to be a princess by playing fun mini-games, including cake decorating, horse racing, and dancing. Restore the castle to its former glory and win the prize! Even after completing the entire magical story, you can take on new challenge objectives to update rooms and photographs.",
